sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant UI as Playground UI
    participant API as Host API
    participant Ingest as person-visual-ingest
    participant S3 as S3 blob store
    participant Stream as message/stream
    participant Pre as PreRouter
    participant Flow as Scenario flow
    participant Ctx as person-visual-context
    participant Ext as person-visual-extract
    participant Ollama as Ollama gemma4
    participant Inbox as Generic inbox

    U->>UI: Attach photo + caption
    UI->>API: init-upload
    API->>Ingest: InitUpload
    Ingest-->>UI: assetId + presigned PUT
    UI->>S3: PUT bytes
    UI->>API: complete + annotate
    API->>Ingest: CompleteUpload / Annotate
    Ingest->>S3: verify

    U->>UI: Send message
    UI->>Stream: payload + attachments[]
    Stream->>Pre: routingContext
    Pre->>Flow: fitness-coach branch
    Flow->>Ctx: BuildContext
    Ctx->>S3: signed URLs
    Ctx-->>Flow: visual appendix
  par Async extract
    Flow->>Ext: Extract
    Ext->>S3: read image
    Ext->>Ollama: POST /api/chat + images
    Ollama-->>Ext: memoryIntents JSON
    Ext->>Inbox: pending proposals
    Stream-->>UI: SSE visual_extract_done
  end
    Flow->>Ollama: chat answer (optional images)
    Stream-->>UI: SSE llm_delta / llm_done
